{"cut_proposal":{"candidate_errors":[],"prefix":"To solve the problem of finding how many positive three-digit numbers are not multiples of 7, we will follow these steps:\n\n1. Determine the total number of three-digit numbers.\n2. Determine how many three-digit numbers are multiples of 7.\n3. Subtract the number of three-digit multiples of 7 from the total number of three-digit numbers to find the number of three-digit numbers that are not multiples of 7.\n\n**Step 1: Determine the total number of three-digit numbers.**\n\nThe smallest three-digit number is 100 and the largest is 999. The total number of three-digit numbers is:\n\\[ 999 - 100 + 1 = 900 \\]\n\n**Step 2: Determine how many three-digit numbers are multiples of 7.**\n\n","prefix_end":679,"status":"review_required"},"eligible":false,"generation":{"generation":{"max_new_tokens":2048,"temperature":0.7,"top_k":0,"top_p":1.0},"ids":[1249,11625,279,3491,315,9271,1246,1657,6785,2326,48342,5109,525,537,65060,315,220,22,11,582,686,1795,1493,7354,1447,16,13,29901,279,2790,1372,315,2326,48342,5109,624,17,13,29901,1246,1657,2326,48342,5109,525,65060,315,220,22,624,18,13,93210,279,1372,315,2326,48342,65060,315,220,22,504,279,2790,1372,315,2326,48342,5109,311,1477,279,1372,315,2326,48342,5109,429,525,537,65060,315,220,22,382,334,8304,220,16,25,29901,279,2790,1372,315,2326,48342,5109,13,56177,785,24632,2326,48342,1372,374,220,16,15,15,323,279,7772,374,220,24,24,24,13,576,2790,1372,315,2326,48342,5109,374,510,78045,220,24,24,24,481,220,16,15,15,488,220,16,284,220,24,15,15,1124,2533,334,8304,220,17,25,29901,1246,1657,2326,48342,5109,525,65060,315,220,22,13,56177,1249,1477,279,1372,315,2326,48342,65060,315,220,22,11,582,1184,311,1477,279,24632,323,7772,2326,48342,65060,315,220,22,13,576,24632,2326,48342,5248,315,220,22,374,220,16,15,20,320,11284,17767,220,16,15,20,284,220,22,1124,15136,220,16,20,1124,593,323,279,7772,374,220,24,24,19,320,11284,17767,220,24,24,19,284,220,22,1124,15136,220,16,19,17,1124,4579,576,65060,315